  "historyNote": "#6909, eff 12-9-98; ss by #6975, eff 4-10-99; ss by #7270, eff 5-12-00; ss by #7929, eff 8-6-03; ss by #8260, eff 1-19-05; ss by #8838, eff 3-9-07; amd and renumbered by #10068, eff 1-10-12 (from Den 301.04); ss by #10689, eff 10-7-14; ss by #13367, eff 4-19-22 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Den 300); renumbered by #14187 (formerly Den 301.06)",
